      "decision": "Exact public NgZone constructor and checker-bound call roles remain supported by the new current joint producer: 10 genuine zone subjects, 70 cases, 46 behavioral fault rejections and 16 source/declaration/evidence controls. Full original producer history is separately replayed on its exact Git source epoch with all prior controls. Fresh whole menu and snack runtime protocol replays cover 10 subjects each and 40/54 faults. The full menu source transition explicitly includes public item alias and query changes, unique panel ID, focus cancellation/teardown and native animation state initialization. The prior `_isAnimating: boolean` field now initializes false with inferred boolean; exact AST and strict type checks constrain that change. The snack worker transition explicitly adds asynchronous disabled-enter waiting. These replays do not qualify full component behavior, native DOM, DI, packed/AOT, timer accuracy, peer floors or G11."
